#, no-wrap
msgid "Take a 20-question exam on the IBM Training site to test your quantum error correction skills and receive a badge through Credly."
msgstr "Ikuti ujian 20 pertanyaan di situs IBM Training untuk menguji kemampuan koreksi kesalahan kuantummu dan terima lencana melalui Credly."

