# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Post-course survey {#post-course-survey}"
msgstr "Survei pasca-kursus {#post-course-survey}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Congratulations on completing the \"Foundations of quantum error correction\" course by IBM! Please take a moment to help us improve our course by filling out the following [quick survey](https://your.feedback.ibm.com/jfe/form/SV_9WuCWHSXP8rXo7Y). Your feedback will be used to enhance our content offering and user experience. Thank you!\n"
msgstr "Selamat telah menyelesaikan course \"Foundations of quantum error correction\" dari IBM! Luangkan waktu sejenak untuk membantu kami meningkatkan course ini dengan mengisi [survei singkat](https://your.feedback.ibm.com/jfe/form/SV_9WuCWHSXP8rXo7Y) berikut. Masukanmu akan digunakan untuk meningkatkan penawaran konten dan pengalaman pengguna kami. Terima kasih!\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Test your knowledge {#test-your-knowledge}"
msgstr "Uji pengetahuanmu {#test-your-knowledge}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After completing the reading and activities in this course, click the button below to navigate to IBM&reg; Training, where you can take the badging exam for Foundations of quantum error correction.\n"
msgstr "Setelah menyelesaikan bacaan dan aktivitas dalam kursus ini, klik tombol di bawah untuk menuju ke IBM&reg; Training, tempat kamu bisa mengikuti ujian lencana untuk Fondasi koreksi kesalahan kuantum.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The exam consists of 20 questions, and you must answer at least 16 correctly to pass. Upon receiving a passing score, your badge will automatically be sent to the email you used to register with IBM&reg; Training.\n"
msgstr "Ujian terdiri dari 20 pertanyaan, dan kamu harus menjawab setidaknya 16 dengan benar untuk lulus. Setelah mendapat nilai lulus, lencana akan otomatis dikirimkan ke email yang kamu gunakan untuk mendaftar di IBM&reg; Training.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Make sure you're ready to take the exam. If you don't receive a passing score in two attempts, the exam becomes temporarily locked.\n"
msgstr "Pastikan kamu siap untuk mengikuti ujian. Jika kamu tidak mendapat nilai lulus dalam dua percobaan, ujian akan terkunci sementara.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<LaunchExamButton href=\"https://www.ibm.com/training/course/foundations-of-quantum-error-correction-badge-quiz-DL46109G\" />\n"
msgstr "<LaunchExamButton href=\"https://www.ibm.com/training/course/foundations-of-quantum-error-correction-badge-quiz-DL46109G\" />\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "NOTICE: IBM leverages the services of Credly, a third-party data processor authorized by IBM and located in the United States, to assist in the administration of the IBM Digital Badge program. In order to issue you an IBM Digital Badge, your personal information (name, email address, and badge earned) will be shared with Credly. You will receive an email notification from Credly with instructions for claiming the badge. Your personal information is used to issue your badge and for program reporting and operational purposes. IBM may share the personal information collected with IBM subsidiaries and third parties globally. It will be handled in a manner consistent with IBM privacy practices. The IBM Privacy Statement can be viewed [here](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/en/). IBM employees can view the IBM Internal Privacy Statement [here](https://w3.ibm.com/w3publisher/w3-privacy-notice).\n"
msgstr "PEMBERITAHUAN: IBM memanfaatkan layanan Credly, pemroses data pihak ketiga yang diotorisasi oleh IBM dan berlokasi di Amerika Serikat, untuk membantu administrasi program IBM Digital Badge. Untuk menerbitkan IBM Digital Badge untukmu, informasi pribadimu (nama, alamat email, dan lencana yang diperoleh) akan dibagikan kepada Credly. Kamu akan menerima notifikasi email dari Credly dengan instruksi untuk mengklaim lencana. Informasi pribadimu digunakan untuk menerbitkan lencana dan untuk pelaporan program serta tujuan operasional. IBM dapat berbagi informasi pribadi yang dikumpulkan dengan anak perusahaan IBM dan pihak ketiga secara global. Hal ini akan ditangani dengan cara yang konsisten dengan praktik privasi IBM. Pernyataan Privasi IBM dapat dilihat [di sini.](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/en/) Karyawan IBM dapat melihat Pernyataan Privasi Internal IBM [di sini.](https://w3.ibm.com/w3publisher/w3-privacy-notice)\n"
